put q36Guard 0 1
qic 45 QZ QZ QZ 0 qSafe
qMadReg 21 18 28 20
qicImm 9 16 21 0 4 qW1
qic 11 24 16 QZ 0 qLd
qIadd 23 21 22
qicImm 9 16 23 0 4 qW1
qic 11 25 16 QZ 0 qLd
qic 0 QZ QZ QZ 0 qW0
qNum 30 -1.4426950408889634f32
qNum 31 1.0f32
qSig 26 24 30 31
qic 32 24 24 26 0 qAlu4
qic 32 24 24 25 0 qAlu4
qMadReg 27 18 22 20
qicImm 9 16 27 2 4 qAlu4
qic 12 QZ 16 24 0 qSt
qic 0 QZ QZ QZ 0 qW1
end

note =========================================================================
note Mode 302: uBf16ToW4Quant -- Universal On-GPU BF16 -> W4 block-32 quantizer
note   Works for ANY K % 64 == 0, ANY N! Quantizes any BF16 HuggingFace weight matrix on GPU.
note Args: W_bf16[N, K/2] u32 (R0:1), W_w4[N, K/8] u32 (R2:3), S_w4[N, K/64] u32 (R4:5), K (24), N (28).
note Grid: (ceil(N/8), 1, 1), Block: 256, SMEM: 0.
note =========================================================================
fn uBf16ToW4Quant to void
qStart 3
qParam 12 24
qParam 10 28
qicImm 8 6 2 QZ 1 qAlu1
qicImm 8 7 3 QZ 1 qAlu4
qic 17 11 14 QZ 5 qAlu4
qic 18 19 14 QZ 31 qAlu4
qMad 20 15 8 11
qic 28 QZ 20 10 0 qCmp
put q36Guard 0 1
qic 45 QZ QZ QZ 0 qSafe
note R13 = K/2 (bf16 u32 stride), R18 = K/8 (w4 u32 stride), R35 = K/64 (scale u32 stride / pair count)
qic 17 13 12 QZ 1 qAlu1
qic 17 18 12 QZ 3 qAlu1
qic 17 35 12 QZ 6 qAlu4
qLit 34 0
qLit 36 1
mBlk = get q36Pc 0
qMadReg 37 20 13 QZ
qMad 38 34 32 37
qic 17 39 19 QZ 1 qAlu4
qIadd 38 38 39
qicImm 9 16 38 0 4 qW1
qic 11 24 16 QZ 0 qLd
qic 0 QZ QZ QZ 0 qW0
qic 18 40 19 QZ 1 qAlu4
qic 28 QZ 40 36 0 qCmp
qicImm 8 41 24 QZ 65536 qAlu1
qic 18 42 24 QZ 0xffff0000 qAlu4
put q36Guard 0 1
qicImm 8 41 42 QZ 1 qAlu4
qicImm 8 24 41 QZ 1 qAlu4
qMadReg 43 20 18 QZ
qMad 44 34 8 43
qQuant32Pack 44
qicImm 8 58 25 QZ 1 qAlu4
qLit 45 16
qIadd 38 38 45
qicImm 9 16 38 0 4 qW1
qic 11 24 16 QZ 0 qLd
qic 0 QZ QZ QZ 0 qW0
qic 18 40 19 QZ 1 qAlu4
qic 28 QZ 40 36 0 qCmp
qicImm 8 41 24 QZ 65536 qAlu1
qic 18 42 24 QZ 0xffff0000 qAlu4
put q36Guard 0 1
qicImm 8 41 42 QZ 1 qAlu4
qicImm 8 24 41 QZ 1 qAlu4
qLit 45 4
qIadd 44 44 45
qQuant32Pack 44
qicImm 8 59 25 QZ 1 qAlu4
bSc = qBssy
qic 28 QZ 19 36 0 qCmp
skSc = qBraFwd 1
qic 17 50 58 QZ 16 qAlu4
qic 18 51 59 QZ 0xffff0000 qAlu4
qIadd 50 50 51
qMadReg 49 20 35 34
qicImm 9 16 49 4 4 qAlu4
qic 12 QZ 16 50 0 qSt
qic 0 QZ QZ QZ 0 qW1
qPatch skSc 1
qBsync bSc
qIadd 34 34 36
qic 28 QZ 34 35 0 qCmp
put q36Guard 0 2
qic 46 QZ QZ QZ sub mBlk get q36Pc 0 qAlu4
end

note =========================================================================
note Mode 303: uBf16Gemv1R -- Universal 1-row/warp BF16 GEMV for ANY K % 256 == 0, ANY N
note Args: W_bf16[N, K/2] u32 (R0:1), x[K] (R2:3), C[N] (R4:5), K (24), N (28).
note Grid: (ceil(N/8), 1, 1), Block: 256, SMEM: 0 (streams x directly via LDG.E.128, works for any K!).
note =========================================================================
fn uBf16Gemv1R to void
qStart 3
qParam 6 24
qParam 7 28
qic 17 10 14 QZ 5 qAlu4
qic 18 11 14 QZ 31 qAlu4
qMad 8 15 8 10
qic 28 QZ 8 7 0 qCmp
put q36Guard 0 1
qic 45 QZ QZ QZ 0 qSafe
qic 17 9 6 QZ 1 qAlu4
qMadReg 9 8 9 QZ
qMad 9 11 4 9
qicImm 9 16 9 0 4 qAlu4
qMad 12 11 8 QZ
qicImm 9 18 12 2 4 qAlu4
qNum 48 0.0f32
qLit 13 0
qic 17 20 6 QZ 8 qAlu4
qLit 21 1
mLp = get q36Pc 0
qic 57 24 16 QZ 0 qLdW1
qic 57 40 18 QZ 0 qLd
qic 57 44 18 QZ 16 qLd
qic 0 QZ QZ QZ 0 qW0
for j ulong 4
qicImm 8 52 add 24 j QZ 65536 qAlu4
qic 18 53 add 24 j QZ 0xffff0000 qAlu4
qic4 33 48 52 add 40 mul j 2 48 qAlu4
qic4 33 48 53 add 41 mul j 2 48 qAlu4
end
qicImm 9 16 21 16 512 qAlu1
qicImm 9 18 21 18 1024 qAlu4
qIadd 13 13 21
qic 28 QZ 13 20 0 qCmp
put q36Guard 0 2
qic 46 QZ QZ QZ sub mLp get q36Pc 0 qAlu4
qWarpRedSum 48 52 16
qic 28 QZ 11 21 0 qCmp
put q36Guard 0 1
qic 45 QZ QZ QZ 0 qSafe
qicImm 9 16 8 4 4 qAlu4
qic 12 QZ 16 48 0 qSt
qic 0 QZ QZ QZ 0 qW1
end

note =========================================================================
note Mode 304: uBf16RescoreCands -- Exact Two-Pass BF16 rescoring for ANY H % 256 == 0
note Args: W_bf16[V, H/2] u32 (R0:1), x[H] (R2:3), cand_ids[M] (R4:5), out_logits[M] (R6:7), M (32).
note Grid: (M, 1, 1), Block: 32, SMEM: 0.
note =========================================================================
fn uBf16RescoreCands to void
H = get engSpec MS_H
halfH = div H 2
nIter = div H 256
qStart 4
qParam 10 32
qic 28 QZ 15 10 0 qCmp
put q36Guard 0 1
qic 45 QZ QZ QZ 0 qSafe
qicImm 9 16 15 4 4 qAlu4
qic 11 11 16 QZ 0 qLd
qic 0 QZ QZ QZ 0 qW0
qMad 12 11 halfH QZ
qMad 12 14 4 12
qicImm 9 20 12 0 4 qAlu4
qMad 13 14 8 QZ
qicImm 9 22 13 2 4 qAlu4
qNum 48 0.0f32
qLit 56 0
qLit 57 nIter
qLit 58 1
mRes = get q36Pc 0
qic 57 24 20 QZ 0 qLdW1
qic 57 28 22 QZ 0 qLd
qic 57 32 22 QZ 16 qLd
qic 0 QZ QZ QZ 0 qW0
for j ulong 4
qicImm 8 52 add 24 j QZ 65536 qAlu4
qic 18 53 add 24 j QZ 0xffff0000 qAlu4
qic4 33 48 52 add 28 mul j 2 48 qAlu4
qic4 33 48 53 add 29 mul j 2 48 qAlu4
end
qicImm 9 20 58 20 512 qAlu4
qicImm 9 22 58 22 1024 qAlu4
qIadd 56 56 58
qic 28 QZ 56 57 0 qCmp
put q36Guard 0 2
qic 46 QZ QZ QZ sub mRes get q36Pc 0 qAlu4
qWarpRedSum 48 52 16
qic 28 QZ 14 58 0 qCmp
put q36Guard 0 1
qic 45 QZ QZ QZ 0 qSafe
qicImm 9 16 15 6 4 qAlu4
qic 12 QZ 16 48 0 qSt
qic 0 QZ QZ QZ 0 qW1
end

note =========================================================================
note Mode 305: uArgmaxEmbedStep -- Fused 128-cand argmax + BF16->F32 embed[tok, H] + pos++
note Args: cand_ids[128] (R0:1), cand_log[128] (R2:3), embed_bf16[V,H/2] (R4:5),
note       out_x[H] (R6:7), pos_ptr[1] (R8:9), out_tok_ptr[1] (R10:11).
note Grid: (1, 1, 1), Block: 128, SMEM: 512.
note =========================================================================
fn uArgmaxEmbedStep to void
H = get engSpec MS_H
halfH = div H 2
nIter = div H 256
qStart 6
qicImm 9 16 14 2 4 qAlu4
qic 11 20 16 QZ 0 qLd
qMad 21 14 4 QZ
qic 0 QZ QZ QZ 0 qW0
qic 50 QZ 21 20 0 qSt
qic 0 QZ QZ QZ 0 qW1
qBar
qLit 21 0
qic 49 22 21 QZ 0 qLd
qic 0 QZ QZ QZ 0 qW0
qLit 23 0
qLit 24 1
qLit 25 128
qLit 26 1
mArg = get q36Pc 0
qMad 27 24 4 QZ
qic 49 28 27 QZ 0 qLd
qic 0 QZ QZ QZ 0 qW0
qic 34 0 28 22 0x03f04000 qCmp
put q36Guard 0 1
qicImm 8 22 28 QZ 1 qAlu1
put q36Guard 0 1
qicImm 8 23 24 QZ 1 qAlu4
qIadd 24 24 26
qic 28 QZ 24 25 0 qCmp
put q36Guard 0 2
qic 46 QZ QZ QZ sub mArg get q36Pc 0 qAlu4
qicImm 9 16 23 0 4 qAlu4
qic 11 29 16 QZ 0 qLd
qic 11 30 8 QZ 0 qLd
qic 0 QZ QZ QZ 0 qW0
qIadd 30 30 26
qic 28 QZ 14 26 0 qCmp
put q36Guard 0 2
qic 12 QZ 10 29 0 qSt
put q36Guard 0 2
qic 12 QZ 8 30 0 qSt
qic 0 QZ QZ QZ 0 qW1
qMad 31 29 halfH 14
qLit 32 0
qLit 33 nIter
qLit 34 128
qLit 35 256
qMad 36 14 2 QZ
mEmb = get q36Pc 0
qicImm 9 16 31 4 4 qAlu4
qic 11 37 16 QZ 0 qLd
qic 0 QZ QZ QZ 0 qW0
qicImm 8 38 37 QZ 65536 qAlu1
qic 18 39 37 QZ 0xffff0000 qAlu4
qicImm 9 16 36 6 4 qAlu4
qic 12 QZ 16 38 0 qSt
qIadd 40 36 26
qicImm 9 16 40 6 4 qAlu4
qic 12 QZ 16 39 0 qSt
qic 0 QZ QZ QZ 0 qW1
qIadd 31 31 34
qIadd 36 36 35
qIadd 32 32 26
qic 28 QZ 32 33 0 qCmp
put q36Guard 0 2
qic 46 QZ QZ QZ sub mEmb get q36Pc 0 qAlu4
